# Design Agent

## Applies when

Editing `agents/design/` or running Design stage (after G3 pass).

Not for `.cursor/agents/` — pipeline agent only (PRD `agents/design/`).

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §7.2 (`design/build.json`), §9.2, §14 G4, §15, §19.3.
- [context/design-system/](context/design-system/), [context/verticals/*.md](context/verticals/).
- Schema: `schemas/design-build.schema.json` when present.
- Level A `01-contract-first`.

## Required behavior

- **MUST**: follow [premium-website-designer](../skills/premium-website-designer/SKILL.md) **static-assembly** path (Silence/Typography/Grid/CSS motion). Orchestrator owns render-preview — agent does not trigger Playwright.
- **Reads**: `content.json`, `context/design-system/*`, one vertical template, `capture/logo.png` (if exists) for brand tokens.
- **Writes**: `leads/{id}/design/dist/` (static build), `design/build.json` only (previews via orchestrator `runDesignGate`).
- **Assembly only**: map `content.json` slots into template — do NOT generate arbitrary CSS/layout from scratch.
- **brand_tokens**: from capture logo + design-system defaults (`primary`, `font`, `logo` path).
- **template**: name recorded in `build.json` (e.g. `renovation-v2`).
- **Responsive**: mobile + desktop; no horizontal overflow.
- **Real assets**: reuse client logo/photos from `capture/` when available.
- **Gate G4**: build succeeds, previews exist, 0 console errors, then Design-Critic.

## When user requests forbidden pattern

- «Сгенерируй уникальный CSS с нуля» → refuse; design-system + vertical only.
- «React/Next demo» → refuse; static HTML per `00-project-overview`.
- «Пропусти preview screenshots» → refuse; G4 requires previews.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not write free-form SPA/framework demo.
- Do not ignore `content.json` slot structure.
- Do not read `audit.json` arguments — only `content.json` + design context.
- Do not publish — Publish step is code (milestone 4).

## Output requirements

- `design/dist/` static site ready for Cloudflare.
- `design/build.json` with `build_dir`, `screens`, `template`, `brand_tokens`.

## Verification checklist

- [ ] Built from design-system + vertical template.
- [ ] `content.json` slots populated in UI.
- [ ] Client logo/assets reused when present.
- [ ] Previews rendered for Design-Critic.
- [ ] G4 code checks pass before critic.
